  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Evaluation of Australia&apos;s Strategic Partnership Frameworks with Key Humanitarian Agencies</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This investment is for an evaluation is to assess the relevance, effectiveness and efficiency of the current multi-year funding agreements (SPFs) with the five key humanitarian partners. The evaluation will identify to what extent the current SPFs are fit-for-purpose, which will inform forthcoming negotiations on a new round of core funding agreements with partners in 2025-26.</narrative>
  </description>
